    "custom_img_text_7JKeap": {
      "type": "custom-img-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_wQidmx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Are Paper Tapes?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_4CwRXB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 1925, Richard Drew invented masking tape after witnessing workers in the automotive industry using butcher paper to cover the cars they were painting. When the workers needed to mask off areas of the vehicle during painting, it became clear the process was frustrating and frequently led to mistakes. Drew’s search for a better, inexpensive alternative led to the development of masking tape and other impregnated paper tapes.</p><p>Paper tapes are manufactured in different grades, and the adhesion value and thickness of the paper can be adjusted according to the user’s needs. Kraft, marking, and packing paper tapes, for example, use a natural, rubber-based adhesive that provides an excellent bond to most surfaces.</p><ul><li>Kraft paper tape features a durable backing that’s moisture-resistant and is often used for carton sealing, packing, splicing, freezer tape, straight-line masking, and outdoor applications.</li><li>Marking tape is also heavy-duty and durable, and it’s usually brightly colored, making it perfect for <a href=\"/collections/1-floor-marking-tapes\" title=\"Facility, Aisle & Floor Marking - TAPES\">floor markings</a>, hazard identification, and delineating aisles or partitions.</li><li>Packing tape (sometimes called <em>packaging tape</em> or <em>shipping tape</em>) is clear so it doesn’t obstruct shipping labels. It’s also durable, temperature-stable, and approved for shipping by the U.S. Postal Service and UPS.</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_wQidmx",
        "text_4CwRXB"
      ],
