    "image_with_text_6YNP3J": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_3yrFHf": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Paper Tape Properties",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_3KEaa6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Paper tapes use a water-activated adhesive and can be applied manually or with an applicator. Most types are recyclable. Different kinds of paper tape feature various properties—for example, you can order custom or standard tape with the following qualities:</p><ul><li>Colors</li><li>Varying degrees of transparency</li><li>Printability for text and images</li><li>Tearable by hand</li><li>Tensile strength</li><li>Temperature tolerance</li><li>Adhesive strength</li><li>Abrasion-resistance</li><li>Removability</li><li>Weight limit</li><li>Water penetration rate</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_3yrFHf",
        "text_3KEaa6"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.name",
      "settings": {
