        },
        "text_Kpm6GK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When it comes to picking the right tape for your unique application, there are many factors to consider, including:</p><ul><li>The surface material and texture</li><li>Environmental exposure</li><li>Tension and frictional force</li><li>How much tape is needed and its dimensions</li><li>The tape opacity and color</li></ul><p>To save you time and money and ensure you get the best tape for the job, NADCO is available to help with selection and ordering. At NADCO, we offer a wide assortment of paper tapes and can provide custom tapes and labels to meet any specification.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
